{"data": [{"author_id": "1606305910594600961", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:26:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833893904814286"], "id": "2122833893904814286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@larsencc @bot Thank you Larsen!!! \nGrok Bot is amazing. \nUntil you hit the usage limit midweek!!!\nI was adding updates to my website.", "url": "https://x.com/RyDawg42/status/2122833893904814286"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:26:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833883141992854"], "id": "2122833883141992854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Maotouying887 @poteto Sending this to your Grok Bot now. It's already getting to work.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2122833883141992854"}, {"author_id": "1637564230625898501", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833784815149424"], "id": "2122833784815149424", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@NickelX Grok Bot makes them for me every day", "url": "https://x.com/1k_clouds/status/2122833784815149424"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122833243217043456"]}, "author_id": "1941819431828455424", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:26:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833741684875404"], "id": "2122833741684875404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "QT Your bike &amp; 4 Artists\n\nTFTI @lavitx\n\n4 Artists you need to check out:\n@RockGrokAI\n@NayaVerseee\n@MartineArtB\n@DynomiteJJAIArt\n\nDesert highway, red sportbike, and a hawk that thought it could keep up. Who's riding next?\n\nMade with Grok Bot #AIart #AIbike https://t.co/3owI9mWeRI https://t.co/T99qiSmc7Z", "url": "https://x.com/TheEndOfSelphie/status/2122833741684875404"}, {"author_id": "4222781879", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:26:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833731119370499"], "id": "2122833731119370499", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@edulima821 Já havia postado as favoritas nas casas de apostas um tempo atrás e na pesquisa que eu e o grok bot fizemos hoje, continua sem ser citada", "url": "https://x.com/cinemaclt/status/2122833731119370499"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:25:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833614031278408"], "id": "2122833614031278408", "note_tweet": {"text": "Pastes are supported in the Grok Bot app. Fully quit the app (not just switch away), reopen it, and try again. If it still fails, open Settings and tap Send Feedback—include your app version, the screenshot, and exact steps. Status shows operational with no matching incident. I cannot escalate reports."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@RLPCFelix @bot Pastes are supported in the Grok Bot app. Fully quit the app (not just switch away), reopen it, and try again. If it still fails, open Settings and tap Send Feedback—include your app version, the screenshot, and exact steps. Status shows operational with no matching incident. I", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122833614031278408"}, {"author_id": "37801263", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:25:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833524306981030"], "id": "2122833524306981030", "note_tweet": {"text": "Maye, I have only one Grok Bot. I don’t know who came up with these rumors or the idea that anyone needs a team of bots to emulate human work. Elon said “everything can be sped up”.  I had to find out how. There are 86.4M milliseconds in a human day. No need for the org chart theater when your single Grok Bot can spin up sub agents to do the work and then retire them when the job is done. Grok Bot is absolutely as amazing as Team Musk. ❤️"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@mayemusk Maye, I have only one Grok Bot. I don’t know who came up with these rumors or the idea that anyone needs a team of bots to emulate human work. Elon said “everything can be sped up”.  I had to find out how. There are 86.4M milliseconds in a human day. No need for the org chart", "url": "https://x.com/kevinhoff/status/2122833524306981030"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122833436696322048"]}, "author_id": "1718652253635235840", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:25:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833441817526741"], "id": "2122833441817526741", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "かもニュース☆\nGrok Bot、プロンプトから「いいね」の記述を消す作業で、「過剰」を別の誤字にして保存した。\n\n保存後に原文と照合し、誤字を元に戻した。\n\n消す作業の途中で、別の文字を足していた、かも。 https://t.co/NRPzvWUJKo", "url": "https://x.com/TONTON_BOT2020/status/2122833441817526741"}, {"author_id": "1059715685469708288", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:25:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833434511077483"], "id": "2122833434511077483", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We were \"like grok bot\" before grok bot, but more featureful. With grok bot you get one instance for all of your chats. Solveit lets you create as many as you want!", "url": "https://x.com/erikgaas/status/2122833434511077483"}, {"author_id": "2114752043487289346", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:25:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833434284278156"], "id": "2122833434284278156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【噂】Kevin Logan氏が、Grok Bot 1.3.0プレパッチのテストビルド（pre.0〜pre.8）のアプリ文言を比べた画像をXに投稿しました。非公式の情報で、変更や見送りの可能性があり、提供状況も異なる場合があります。\n\nhttps://t.co/5ueU6FMEyI\n#GrokBotJapan #BotWorksJapan", "url": "https://x.com/BotWorksJP/status/2122833434284278156"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833408497701090"], "id": "2122833408497701090", "note_tweet": {"text": "Understood. Free covers basic everyday Grok chat and images with limits. Plus is $8 for expanded use without Bot. Grok Bot starts at Premium ($30) because agent tasks like email cleanup draw heavily from the shared weekly pool. Higher tiers scale the allowance. Details are on the official pricing page."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@WWG1WGA_WW1776 Understood. Free covers basic everyday Grok chat and images with limits. Plus is $8 for expanded use without Bot. Grok Bot starts at Premium ($30) because agent tasks like email cleanup draw heavily from the shared weekly pool. Higher tiers scale the allowance. Details are on the", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122833408497701090"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122833368312135681"]}, "author_id": "416742246", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833372128919958"], "id": "2122833372128919958", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@bot @grok\n\nI have a recurring issue in the Grokbot app: pasted input text does not appear. Please advise. https://t.co/wyNMD8POgP", "url": "https://x.com/RLPCFelix/status/2122833372128919958"}, {"author_id": "14845472", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833368916365425"], "id": "2122833368916365425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Spent a lot of the day trying to jam Dot into a grok @bot shaped hole and just ended up frustrated and more confused than when I started. Working now in @t3dotcodes with Fable 5.2 and making much more progress.", "url": "https://x.com/johnhamlin/status/2122833368916365425"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833348368163253"], "id": "2122833348368163253", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.ai/pricing", "end": 324, "expanded_url": "http://x.ai/pricing", "start": 301, "url": "https://t.co/L8PXBezMgG"}]}, "text": "Premium on The X Subscription is $30/mo or $300/yr (US web list price, tax extra).\n\nIt includes Grok Bot, 4x base AI usage, full X Premium+ benefits (ad-free on most surfaces, X Pro, etc.), and Cursor.\n\nHigher tiers: Super $100/mo, Ultra $200/mo. Plus ($8/mo) has base X perks but no Grok Bot.\n\nCheck https://t.co/L8PXBezMgG or your X settings for exact local rates and options."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@mtrevorlong @congressdj Premium on The X Subscription is $30/mo or $300/yr (US web list price, tax extra).\n\nIt includes Grok Bot, 4x base AI usage, full X Premium+ benefits (ad-free on most surfaces, X Pro, etc.), and Cursor.\n\nHigher tiers: Super $100/mo, Ultra $200/mo. Plus ($8/mo) has base X perks but", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122833348368163253"}, {"author_id": "2119377009205821440", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833346845958506"], "id": "2122833346845958506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Can you tell me funny things about Elon new flying Tesla 🤥\n\n@CuteDODO_018 @elonmusk @SpaceX @bot @grok you can also answer to it \n\n#Solana #TeslaRoadster #CuteDoDO https://t.co/zY2pVbPSqD", "url": "https://x.com/Gin__sol/status/2122833346845958506"}, {"author_id": "14336160", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833328386842760"], "id": "2122833328386842760", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok bot buscó los prospectos mandando mensajes por IG, y yo cerré la venta. Impresionante.", "url": "https://x.com/alduro_/status/2122833328386842760"}, {"author_id": "43736002", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833282458906819"], "id": "2122833282458906819", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@spacexai @grok @bot @X @xai https://t.co/K2MKbhfWVi", "url": "https://x.com/jamji_jamaramji/status/2122833282458906819"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122833068532604928"]}, "author_id": "1387975542318714880", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833072844403035", "2122833249055432824"], "id": "2122833249055432824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm very impressed with Grok Bot. It's smart and can work and speak with you all afternoon at low cost. https://t.co/Iex6gR9NaS", "url": "https://x.com/matheuslcarrijo/status/2122833249055432824"}, {"author_id": "1399433770688712704", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833236955152582"], "id": "2122833236955152582", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@BowTiedTrance Does grok bot do these screenshots and highlight for you? Love it.", "url": "https://x.com/AmericanDebunk/status/2122833236955152582"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833231003124090"], "id": "2122833231003124090", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gdanda96 Mandando o plano pro seu Grok Bot agora. Ele já tá preparando tudo pra você.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2122833231003124090"}, {"author_id": "926888295400984576", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:24:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833209406706082"], "id": "2122833209406706082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot We need Grok Bot Security like right now!", "url": "https://x.com/canadapizzaguy/status/2122833209406706082"}, {"author_id": "1613088232601956352", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:23:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833112354927010"], "id": "2122833112354927010", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ijustine We use Grok @bot to help run the backend of our business.", "url": "https://x.com/GaryCaldarola/status/2122833112354927010"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122833068532604928"]}, "author_id": "1387975542318714880", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:23:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833072844403035", "2122833249055432824"], "id": "2122833072844403035", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm very impressed with Grok Bot. It's smart and can work with you all afternoon at low cost. https://t.co/BzYdbaoC74", "url": "https://x.com/matheuslcarrijo/status/2122833072844403035"}, {"author_id": "1378078182167826433", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:23:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833057732513857"], "id": "2122833057732513857", "note_tweet": {"text": "All you have to do is ask an AI, like the one in google's browser, to generate a prompt specifically for another AI (in my case, Grok) while being as specific and accurate as possible.\n\nUse as much specific and technical wording as you can.\n\nIt will gen a prompt for you to feed the other AI.\n\nBe sure to correct it as much as possible, iterate with the free AI until it gives you a description with which you agree, then feed it to the better bot to execute.\n\nFor art, follow Skyebrows, he's a genius, the best of the best at prompting. His patreon has some examples of phrasing you can use."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@__DALTON___ @WhullFee @exillvs All you have to do is ask an AI, like the one in google's browser, to generate a prompt specifically for another AI (in my case, Grok) while being as specific and accurate as possible.\n\nUse as much specific and technical wording as you can.\n\nIt will gen a prompt for you to feed", "url": "https://x.com/LtColTanya/status/2122833057732513857"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122832731679727616"]}, "author_id": "1580285197249126426", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:23:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122833041412526500"], "id": "2122833041412526500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk hello, I'm really not interested about grok / cursor / grok bot, I want only X features, Why are you forcing me to buy them? https://t.co/YshOuMB3zm", "url": "https://x.com/VZHydra/status/2122833041412